          "sdg_note": "The project description's SDG section (§2.1.18, p.45) states that the project \"will aid Kenya with its efforts to meet all the Sustainable Development Goals\" and then lists all seventeen, one paragraph each — including #14 Life below water. It is the VCS template's boilerplate section filled in maximally, not a per-indicator attribution. An earlier pass carried a plausible subset here (communities-engaged [10, 11, 17], womens-participation [5], local-jobs [1, 5, 8]); that subset was an editorial inference, not a reading of the source, so it was removed rather than kept behind a caveat — a badge is too compact a format to carry the distinction. Restore a mapping here only from a document that attributes specific goals to this specific indicator, as the CIP one-pager does for the three indicators that keep their badges."
